1
00:00:06,874 --> 00:00:09,743
[The seeker carefully checks inside]

2
00:00:14,515 --> 00:00:18,285
[But, just leaves?]

3
00:00:19,153 --> 00:00:22,056
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps fading away]

4
00:00:43,677 --> 00:00:46,180
[KIM TAE RAE, I found you!]
I found you!

5
00:00:46,981 --> 00:00:49,450
[Screams heard from afar]

6
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:50,050
Hey!

7
00:00:50,083 --> 00:00:51,318
Hey! Come out

8
00:00:51,385 --> 00:00:51,985
right now!

9
00:00:52,019 --> 00:00:52,519
Let’s go. Let’s go.

10
00:00:52,553 --> 00:00:53,620
Move, move.

11
00:00:53,888 --> 00:00:55,789
[HAO and GYU VIN hides again while someone else is being caught]

12
00:00:55,923 --> 00:00:56,923
[ZHANG HAO, KIM GYU VIN]

13
00:00:57,058 --> 00:00:58,125
Hurry!

14
00:00:58,292 --> 00:01:00,661
[KIM TAE RAE going to prison →]
[ZHANG HAO↑] [KIM GYU VIN↑]

15
00:01:09,737 --> 00:01:11,238
TAE RAE has been captured.

16
00:01:13,874 --> 00:01:15,576
Wait, you’re captured?

17
00:01:19,179 --> 00:01:20,748
Help me!

18
00:01:21,148 --> 00:01:23,584
[At that moment, GYU VIN arrives at the prison with the key]

19
00:01:23,651 --> 00:01:25,319
Save YU JIN!

20
00:01:25,486 --> 00:01:25,886
YU JIN.

21
00:01:25,953 --> 00:01:28,822
[Rescues YU JIN who has been in prison the longest]

22
00:01:29,089 --> 00:01:30,889
Hey, hurry up and come over here.

23
00:01:31,025 --> 00:01:31,825
Hurry up! Hurry up!

24
00:01:35,029 --> 00:01:36,569
I really wanted to runaway

25
00:01:36,597 --> 00:01:38,398
but my legs couldn’t move.

26
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:47,941
[The seeker]
[Water park - SUNG HAN BIN, RICKY]

27
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:51,578
[The seeker heads to the Water park]

28
00:01:51,612 --> 00:01:53,992
[← SUNG HAN BIN & RICKY]
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps]
Hey, hey!

29
00:01:54,648 --> 00:01:56,850
Isn’t it (the seeker) coming?

30
00:02:00,688 --> 00:02:03,624
[Heads over to HAN BIN and RICKY]

31
00:02:05,292 --> 00:02:06,660
The seeker is nearby.

32
00:02:12,332 --> 00:02:13,800
[Heads inside the supply rental center]

33
00:02:13,934 --> 00:02:15,235
Oh, no.

34
00:02:15,469 --> 00:02:18,172
[← SUNG HAN BIN & RICKY]

35
00:02:24,111 --> 00:02:25,713
(Lights off)

36
00:02:27,481 --> 00:02:29,116
[The seeker →]

37
00:02:37,325 --> 00:02:39,927
[The sound of the seeker’s cane]

38
00:02:43,163 --> 00:02:49,269
[HAN BIN hides in
complete silence]

39
00:02:51,905 --> 00:03:00,180
[The sound of the seeker’s cane getting louder]

40
00:03:05,886 --> 00:03:08,422
[SUNG HAN BIN, I found you!]

41
00:03:11,625 --> 00:03:13,760
Ah, you scared me.

42
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,660
I found you!

43
00:03:14,695 --> 00:03:16,530
Ah, you scared me.

44
00:03:17,164 --> 00:03:19,066
Why do you look so scary?

45
00:03:19,366 --> 00:03:20,366
Ah...

46
00:03:21,769 --> 00:03:23,169
Ah, my heart.

47
00:03:24,172 --> 00:03:26,540
[HAN BIN comes out with the seeker]

48
00:03:27,741 --> 00:03:29,543
[RICKY successfully survives]

49
00:03:32,446 --> 00:03:33,814
As expected,

50
00:03:34,548 --> 00:03:35,816
I’m so good.

51
00:03:40,887 --> 00:03:44,057
[Impossible to escape after 20 minutes
JI WOONG checks the remaining time.]

52
00:03:44,057 --> 00:03:45,392
What the?

53
00:03:46,493 --> 00:03:48,495
I was really scared.

54
00:03:53,467 --> 00:03:55,767
We’re in big trouble

55
00:03:55,769 --> 00:03:56,369
if two more people are caught.

56
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:58,237
We are?

57
00:03:58,272 --> 00:04:00,405
Because 5 people need to be alive in order to win the game.

58
00:04:00,407 --> 00:04:01,407
Ah, really?

59
00:04:01,975 --> 00:04:03,655
- So, that’s why we need the key to save people.
- Yes.

60
00:04:03,711 --> 00:04:05,211
I

61
00:04:05,312 --> 00:04:06,312
will

62
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,480
definitely go and find the keys.

63
00:04:07,548 --> 00:04:08,848
Are you going to leave right now?

64
00:04:09,483 --> 00:04:10,303
[JI WOONG already had a key]

65
00:04:10,384 --> 00:04:11,284
What?!

66
00:04:11,318 --> 00:04:12,318
Hold on.

67
00:04:12,352 --> 00:04:12,852
Hold on a sec.

68
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,320
Don’t leave just now.

69
00:04:14,388 --> 00:04:15,588
Let’s see who comes next

70
00:04:15,589 --> 00:04:17,049
because I also have a key.

71
00:04:17,057 --> 00:04:17,657
- Really?
- Yes.

72
00:04:17,724 --> 00:04:18,344
Wait, you guys both have a key?

73
00:04:18,459 --> 00:04:19,259
I found one, too.

74
00:04:19,526 --> 00:04:20,927
I’m the only one who doesn’t have one?

75
00:04:23,697 --> 00:04:25,097
You do know that

76
00:04:25,098 --> 00:04:26,666
even if you have the key, if you don’t leave

77
00:04:26,667 --> 00:04:28,502
within 20 minutes,

78
00:04:28,502 --> 00:04:30,202
you can’t leave until the game is over.

79
00:04:30,237 --> 00:04:30,537
Okay.

80
00:04:30,570 --> 00:04:32,170
Then, let’s leave

81
00:04:33,173 --> 00:04:34,274
1 minute later.

82
00:04:34,374 --> 00:04:35,374
Good idea.

83
00:04:35,809 --> 00:04:39,213
[Current survivors are 6 people]

84
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:39,746
[Member’s location]

85
00:04:39,847 --> 00:04:41,148
[RICKY]

86
00:04:41,248 --> 00:04:42,648
[Water park - SEOK MATTHEW, KIM GYU VIN, HAN YU JIN]

87
00:04:42,649 --> 00:04:44,084
[Lobby - ZHANG HAO, PARK GUN WOOK]

88
00:04:45,085 --> 00:04:47,688
[HAO heads to the lobby

89
00:04:54,395 --> 00:04:56,930
[GUN WOOK is also at the lobby]

90
00:05:01,301 --> 00:05:03,170
Oh, you scared me.

91
00:05:04,037 --> 00:05:05,237
Should we hide here?

92
00:05:05,339 --> 00:05:06,139
Can we?

93
00:05:06,206 --> 00:05:07,941
No, no I don’t like it here.

94
00:05:08,675 --> 00:05:10,677
It’s too revealing once you open the door.

95
00:05:10,844 --> 00:05:11,664
[MATTHEW, GYU VIN, YU JIN gathers at the Water park]

96
00:05:11,678 --> 00:05:12,478
Hey!

97
00:05:12,479 --> 00:05:13,379
- What?
- Run, run

98
00:05:13,447 --> 00:05:13,747
Why, why?

99
00:05:13,747 --> 00:05:15,015
On the other side.

100
00:05:15,449 --> 00:05:17,551
It’s over there, it’s over there, it’s over there.

101
00:05:17,751 --> 00:05:19,352
The seeker is coming, coming, coming.

102
00:05:21,355 --> 00:05:22,890
The seeker is coming, coming, coming.

103
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:33,233
[Hides in Locker Room B]

104
00:05:34,468 --> 00:05:36,169
Run YU JIN! Just run away!

105
00:05:41,075 --> 00:05:44,711
[MATTHEW heads to the lobby]

106
00:05:45,479 --> 00:05:48,983
[The seeker]

107
00:05:50,550 --> 00:05:51,630
The seeker is coming this way.

108
00:05:52,719 --> 00:05:53,999
I hear the seeker’s footsteps!

109
00:05:55,189 --> 00:05:57,024
Where is it coming from?

110
00:05:57,591 --> 00:05:58,591
I don’t know

111
00:05:59,426 --> 00:06:00,426
Hold on.

112
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:07,300
Where did the seeker go?

113
00:06:07,501 --> 00:06:09,181
Hey, can’t we just fight it and win?

114
00:06:09,369 --> 00:06:10,971
Hey! It’s taller than me.

115
00:06:11,038 --> 00:06:12,205
It’s taller than you?

116
00:06:12,205 --> 00:06:13,105
Similar to you.

117
00:06:13,106 --> 00:06:14,106
I’ll fight it for you.

118
00:06:14,641 --> 00:06:15,941
Where is the exit?

119
00:06:16,610 --> 00:06:18,545
Is this the only exit?

120
00:06:18,812 --> 00:06:19,913
There’s one over there.

121
00:06:19,946 --> 00:06:21,481
Is there one over there, too?

122
00:06:22,482 --> 00:06:23,282
What if the seeker

123
00:06:23,317 --> 00:06:25,285
[The sound of the automatic door opening]

124
00:06:27,754 --> 00:06:29,054
is behind the door?

125
00:06:29,122 --> 00:06:30,523
Why is everyone here?

126
00:06:32,926 --> 00:06:33,926
They were all here this whole time?

127
00:06:33,961 --> 00:06:34,461
Is the seeker gone?

128
00:06:34,695 --> 00:06:35,862
It went out that way.

129
00:06:37,364 --> 00:06:37,964
What are we looking for now?

130
00:06:37,965 --> 00:06:38,765
Where do we need to go?

131
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:42,600
[Hint for the key]

132
00:06:42,636 --> 00:06:43,536
Did you look here?

133
00:06:43,770 --> 00:06:44,404
I went to the spot next to the ice cream.

134
00:06:44,438 --> 00:06:45,238
I had some ice cream as well.

135
00:06:45,806 --> 00:06:47,474
But it says the key is in this place.

136
00:06:48,075 --> 00:06:49,115
I know where this place is.

137
00:06:50,443 --> 00:06:51,443
It was where I first woke up.

138
00:06:52,012 --> 00:06:53,172
Who’s locked up in prison right now?

139
00:06:53,213 --> 00:06:55,113
HAN BIN, JI WOONG, TAE RAE

140
00:06:55,115 --> 00:06:56,335
Then, are we the only ones alive?

141
00:06:56,383 --> 00:06:57,223
Wait, there was one more person...

142
00:06:57,284 --> 00:06:58,084
Where is RICKY?

143
00:06:58,952 --> 00:07:00,028
We’re  just... staying in this one place...

144
00:07:00,053 --> 00:07:01,253
[The seeker’s scream]

145
00:07:01,255 --> 00:07:01,855
RICKY has been caught.

146
00:07:01,889 --> 00:07:02,489
Has RICKY been caught?

147
00:07:02,556 --> 00:07:03,156
I think so.

148
00:07:03,156 --> 00:07:03,956
No, no, no

149
00:07:04,024 --> 00:07:05,024
It usually screams by itself.

150
00:07:05,125 --> 00:07:05,725
Ah, really?

151
00:07:05,725 --> 00:07:07,025
It was screaming by itself before it tried to catch me.

152
00:07:08,729 --> 00:07:10,530
Shouldn’t we head for the ice cream spot? Ice cream?

153
00:07:10,530 --> 00:07:12,599
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps getting closer]

154
00:07:16,937 --> 00:07:19,706
[All the members runs to Locker Room B]

155
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:22,142
Run, runaway!

156
00:07:29,683 --> 00:07:32,452
[Meanwhile, in the supply rental center where RICKY is hiding]

157
00:07:36,924 --> 00:07:39,025
I like it here.

158
00:07:39,893 --> 00:07:40,993
I found the ice cream spot.

159
00:07:40,994 --> 00:07:41,594
[Hint for the key]

160
00:07:41,594 --> 00:07:42,729
The key is in here?

161
00:07:46,032 --> 00:07:46,933
Hey!

162
00:07:47,267 --> 00:07:48,167
In the ice!

163
00:07:48,268 --> 00:07:49,168
It’s inside the ice.

164
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,604
Ah, how are we going to melt it?

165
00:07:51,771 --> 00:07:53,606
[Finds the key inside the ice]

166
00:07:54,107 --> 00:07:55,875
[GUN WOOK heads to the Sauna]

167
00:08:02,048 --> 00:08:05,986
[Hint for the key]

168
00:08:07,187 --> 00:08:08,187
I'll stand guard.

169
00:08:09,089 --> 00:08:13,493
[Carefully searches the human figure from the hint]

170
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:23,670
Did you find it?

171
00:08:23,703 --> 00:08:24,738
No.

172
00:08:29,276 --> 00:08:31,211
[Fails to find the key and leaves]

173
00:08:38,819 --> 00:08:39,819
Hey!

174
00:08:39,886 --> 00:08:41,287
It’s coming! Hey, it’s coming!

175
00:08:45,558 --> 00:08:46,826
[All the members gathered at Locker Room B]

176
00:08:47,427 --> 00:08:49,729
[Heads to the Water park after hearing the seeker]

177
00:08:50,197 --> 00:08:51,064
Hey, where is the ice?

178
00:08:51,097 --> 00:08:51,997
The ice?

179
00:08:51,998 --> 00:08:53,233
I gave it to GYU VIN.

180
00:08:53,767 --> 00:08:55,468
Put the ice in the water.

181
00:08:55,502 --> 00:08:56,202
Is it hot water?

182
00:08:56,269 --> 00:08:57,637
It won’t make any noise if we break it in the water.

183
00:08:57,737 --> 00:08:59,105
Ah, you’re right.

184
00:09:01,441 --> 00:09:03,810
[The sound of breaking the ice]

185
00:09:04,878 --> 00:09:06,746
It’s broken, broken, broken.

186
00:09:07,414 --> 00:09:09,883
No, it’s just the light from the key chain.

187
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:15,388
[There’s only a key chain but not the key?]

188
00:09:15,989 --> 00:09:18,758
[← The key]
[It sank underwater once the ice broke]

189
00:09:18,792 --> 00:09:19,893
Oh! The seeker is coming.

190
00:09:19,959 --> 00:09:20,959
It’s over there?

191
00:09:23,897 --> 00:09:26,566
[HAO and GYU VIN heads to Locker Room B again]

192
00:09:26,666 --> 00:09:31,438
[ZHANG HAO, KIM GYU VIN]
[SEOK MATTHEW, HAN YU JIN]

193
00:09:31,705 --> 00:09:34,074
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

194
00:09:35,275 --> 00:09:36,576
[The seeker appears]

195
00:09:36,609 --> 00:09:42,348
[SEOK MATTHEW, HAN YU JIN] [ZHANG HAO, KIM GYU VIN]
[The seeker]

196
00:09:44,117 --> 00:09:46,186
[↑ ZHANG HAO]

197
00:09:46,319 --> 00:09:48,087
[Spots HAO running to the Water park]

198
00:09:48,221 --> 00:09:49,489
[PARK GUN WOOK →]

199
00:09:52,225 --> 00:09:52,892
Huh, what the?

200
00:09:53,727 --> 00:09:55,028
[← HAN YU JIN] [SEOK MATTHEW ↓] [ZHANG HAO →]

201
00:09:55,028 --> 00:09:55,829
[SEOK MATTHEW ↓]

202
00:09:58,298 --> 00:10:00,967
[The seeker →]

203
00:10:04,404 --> 00:10:07,340
[The seeker was one step behind]

204
00:10:11,478 --> 00:10:14,781
[HAO heads to the supply rental center]

205
00:10:17,584 --> 00:10:20,987
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps wandering around]

206
00:10:24,624 --> 00:10:25,625
Who is it?

207
00:10:25,692 --> 00:10:26,259
It’s me!

208
00:10:26,359 --> 00:10:27,460
Okay, okay.

209
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:29,028
[Phone alarm]

210
00:10:29,529 --> 00:10:33,122
Later, once the play time is

211
00:10:33,151 --> 00:10:36,002
2,222 seconds, the seeker will suddenly disappear

212
00:10:36,002 --> 00:10:38,872
and you will have 4 minutes to hide yourself again.
But this time hide yourself very well.

213
00:10:39,138 --> 00:10:41,941
The 4 minutes will start when the ‘hide-and-seek’ song begins.

214
00:10:42,041 --> 00:10:45,311
Within 4 minutes, you can not go save your team members.

215
00:10:45,612 --> 00:10:49,616
After 4 minutes, there will be two seekers. So, good luck hiding.

216
00:10:50,383 --> 00:10:52,585
The key. 4 minutes.

217
00:10:53,153 --> 00:10:54,954
Weren’t there two seekers already??

218
00:10:54,954 --> 00:10:56,522
Hey, you told me you saw two seekers?

219
00:10:56,523 --> 00:10:57,924
Yeah, I’m pretty sure I saw two seekers.

220
00:10:58,391 --> 00:11:00,927
[Remaining time]

221
00:11:01,261 --> 00:11:04,831
[At the same time, in the snack bar]

222
00:11:04,856 --> 00:11:07,901
[※ Filmed with prior permission]

223
00:11:09,302 --> 00:11:10,402
Oh my god.

224
00:11:10,436 --> 00:11:13,139
Let’s give some ice cream to them.

225
00:11:16,209 --> 00:11:17,610
What is this?

226
00:11:17,644 --> 00:11:18,745
Where did you get all of these?

227
00:11:18,978 --> 00:11:20,947
Thank you, MATTHEW.

228
00:11:21,014 --> 00:11:23,449
MATTHEW is giving out free food.

229
00:11:23,583 --> 00:11:25,385
This prison has some good food.

230
00:11:35,495 --> 00:11:36,829
[The seeker disappears]

231
00:11:37,264 --> 00:11:40,934
[4 minutes of free time]

232
00:11:44,304 --> 00:11:45,905
[MATTHEW and GYU VIN meets at the Water park]

233
00:11:46,173 --> 00:11:47,540
It’s pretty deep...

234
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:48,108
What?

235
00:11:48,208 --> 00:11:48,441
Did you drop it here?

236
00:11:48,441 --> 00:11:49,441
Is the key in there?

237
00:11:51,011 --> 00:11:52,278
Hey, it’s super deep.

238
00:11:52,278 --> 00:11:53,279
[← The fallen key
from the ice]

239
00:11:53,346 --> 00:11:54,781
You have to get wet no matter what.

240
00:11:57,917 --> 00:11:59,285
Okay, why not?

241
00:12:01,988 --> 00:12:04,424
[Puts out his arm to reach for the key]
Can you just hold this?

242
00:12:05,358 --> 00:12:06,459
Go, go, go!

243
00:12:09,930 --> 00:12:11,630
I can’t reach it. I can’t reach it.

244
00:12:11,665 --> 00:12:13,033
Ah, hold on.

245
00:12:15,468 --> 00:12:16,636
What should we do?

246
00:12:16,670 --> 00:12:18,423
Let’s go find something

247
00:12:18,471 --> 00:12:18,871
long to use.

248
00:12:18,938 --> 00:12:20,640
How about you go look for something else.

249
00:12:20,673 --> 00:12:21,473
Okay!

250
00:12:26,847 --> 00:12:27,647
[Hint for the key]

251
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:30,080
Then wait, let me go to the sauna room

252
00:12:30,116 --> 00:12:31,316
and find the key.

253
00:12:32,385 --> 00:12:33,685
RICKY, RICKY!

254
00:12:33,687 --> 00:12:35,187
Let’s go! Now!

255
00:12:35,321 --> 00:12:36,621
We only have 4 minutes left.

256
00:12:36,623 --> 00:12:37,223
What are you going to do?

257
00:12:37,257 --> 00:12:38,424
Right now, we have 4 minutes.

258
00:12:38,558 --> 00:12:39,458
I know, I know. So, what are we going to do?

259
00:12:39,459 --> 00:12:41,359
You don’t have a key, right?

260
00:12:41,428 --> 00:12:42,228
Yup!

261
00:12:42,295 --> 00:12:43,696
Let’s go find the key!

262
00:12:48,802 --> 00:12:50,070
Ha.. my legs are killing me.

263
00:12:58,979 --> 00:13:01,714
[GYU VIN is still struggling to find the keys]

264
00:13:09,123 --> 00:13:11,124
[Decides to dive in]
Hey, GYU VIN!

265
00:13:19,566 --> 00:13:21,401
Did you really go in?

266
00:13:22,068 --> 00:13:23,068
To find the key?

267
00:13:23,136 --> 00:13:23,936
Yeah.

268
00:13:23,937 --> 00:13:24,837
Did you find it?

269
00:13:24,838 --> 00:13:25,938
I did.

270
00:13:28,275 --> 00:13:29,275
You’re insane.

271
00:13:30,810 --> 00:13:33,850
[KIM GYU VIN finds the key]

272
00:13:33,947 --> 00:13:34,547
Hey, TAE RAE!

273
00:13:34,614 --> 00:13:35,214
Yes?

274
00:13:35,215 --> 00:13:36,355
How many seconds are left in the timer?

275
00:13:36,716 --> 00:13:37,817
Ah, you have to check that?

276
00:13:37,917 --> 00:13:39,017
Yup.

277
00:13:39,085 --> 00:13:40,586
I have 4 minutes left.

278
00:13:40,587 --> 00:13:41,487
4 minutes?

279
00:13:41,655 --> 00:13:43,022
[KIM JI WOONG - order of capture: 1] [SUNG HAN BIN - order of capture: 3]
[KIM TAE RAE - order of capture: 2]
You have to leave now, TAE RAE.

280
00:13:43,022 --> 00:13:43,666
You have to leave right now.

281
00:13:43,690 --> 00:13:45,358
You’re going to be locked up if you don’t leave.

282
00:13:45,425 --> 00:13:45,745
But, can you really

283
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:47,794
[HAN BIN confuses the order of capture ]
hide well?

284
00:13:48,228 --> 00:13:49,796
Hey, I’m pretty quick.

285
00:13:50,296 --> 00:13:51,696
You leave first.

286
00:13:51,798 --> 00:13:53,973
I'm the one who has the most time.

287
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,269
[Actually, JI WOONG has the least amount of time]

288
00:13:56,570 --> 00:13:58,939
[TAE RAE rescued by HAN BIN’s key]

289
00:14:02,542 --> 00:14:04,444
[A few moments later]

290
00:14:05,078 --> 00:14:08,181
[The gatekeeper approaching JI WOONG]

291
00:14:09,149 --> 00:14:10,583
Why?

292
00:14:11,685 --> 00:14:12,685
Has it been 20 minutes?

293
00:14:12,819 --> 00:14:15,188
[Has it been 20 minutes already?]
Ah! It seems that it was delayed because the timer stopped.

294
00:14:16,623 --> 00:14:17,423
[A few minutes back]

295
00:14:17,424 --> 00:14:18,624
Don’t forget to check the time.

296
00:14:18,725 --> 00:14:20,226
What is the time difference between us?

297
00:14:21,961 --> 00:14:23,261
How many minutes do you have left?

298
00:14:23,329 --> 00:14:24,689
The timer was paused.

299
00:14:26,866 --> 00:14:28,968
[JI WOONG accidently stopped the timer]

300
00:14:29,436 --> 00:14:31,816
[The actual time and the timer’s time was different]

301
00:14:32,438 --> 00:14:35,241
[Exceeded 20 minutes,
KIM JI WOONG can not escape from prison]
But, I didn’t press the stop button.

302
00:14:35,308 --> 00:14:36,428
This is so unfair.

303
00:14:46,887 --> 00:14:50,823
Ready or not,

304
00:14:50,990 --> 00:14:53,626
here I come.

305
00:14:54,794 --> 00:14:57,530
[As the 4 minutes are coming to a close]

306
00:14:58,331 --> 00:15:01,101
[HAO heads to the storage room in the cafeteria]

307
00:15:06,005 --> 00:15:07,440
Oh my god.

308
00:15:09,342 --> 00:15:11,211
[RICKY heads to the supply rental center again]

309
00:15:18,985 --> 00:15:21,955
[Uses the tubes to hide himself properly]

310
00:15:23,523 --> 00:15:27,323
Ready or not,

311
00:15:27,427 --> 00:15:30,430
here I come.

312
00:15:33,666 --> 00:15:34,767
I found it.

313
00:15:35,268 --> 00:15:37,069
[PARK GUN WOOK finds the key (in the human figure)]

314
00:15:37,470 --> 00:15:38,205
Huh! What happened?

315
00:15:38,271 --> 00:15:39,011
Oh, no!

316
00:15:39,205 --> 00:15:40,940
Hey, did you go in the water?

317
00:15:41,307 --> 00:15:42,809
HAN BIN, please.

318
00:15:43,242 --> 00:15:45,678
[GYU VIN saves SUNG HAN BIN with his key]

319
00:15:50,316 --> 00:15:51,651
I found it. x4

320
00:15:51,751 --> 00:15:53,987
[HAN YU JIN finds the key (inside the microwave)]

321
00:15:54,788 --> 00:15:58,591
Ready or not,

322
00:15:58,616 --> 00:16:01,761
two seekers are coming to get you.

323
00:16:03,563 --> 00:16:07,467
[After escaping,
HAN BIN hides under a bench in Locker Room B]

324
00:16:08,668 --> 00:16:10,570
I should’ve ran away further. Ah...

325
00:16:11,604 --> 00:16:15,007
[MATTHEW hides in the playroom on the 1st floor Sauna]

326
00:16:23,216 --> 00:16:24,502
It’s coming. x3

327
00:16:25,029 --> 00:16:26,752
It’s coming. x3

328
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:29,455
[↑ KIM TAE RAE] [PARK GUN WOOK ↓]

329
00:16:29,866 --> 00:16:32,291
[TAE RAE and GUN WOOK are at the small pool on the 1st floor Water park]

330
00:16:34,566 --> 00:16:36,462
[YU JIN is at the playroom on the 2nd floor Water park]

331
00:16:38,398 --> 00:16:39,799
What should I do?

332
00:16:39,878 --> 00:16:41,467
I can’t leave.

333
00:16:42,769 --> 00:16:45,004
Are you done hiding?

334
00:16:45,037 --> 00:16:46,872
I’m coming to get you, again!

335
00:16:48,207 --> 00:16:50,543
[Hide-and-seek restart]

336
00:16:58,651 --> 00:17:00,086
Ah, time is up.

337
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:03,456
I think the two seekers are going to come in any second!

338
00:17:03,556 --> 00:17:05,057
The two seekers

339
00:17:10,163 --> 00:17:13,199
[KIM TAE RAE ↓] [PARK GUN WOOK ↓]

340
00:17:13,199 --> 00:17:15,201
I just came out of prison.

341
00:17:15,768 --> 00:17:17,536
Anyhow, I’m safe for now.

342
00:17:18,914 --> 00:17:20,238
Nothing seems to be easy.

343
00:17:21,580 --> 00:17:24,176
[GUN WOOK is located at the small pool on the 1st floor]

344
00:17:24,711 --> 00:17:25,811
[YU JIN heads to the 2nd floor playroom]

345
00:17:25,812 --> 00:17:28,047
[HAN YU JIN →]
[PARK GUN WOOK ↑]

346
00:17:29,878 --> 00:17:31,517
GUN WOOK!

347
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,490
Why did you come here?

348
00:17:40,013 --> 00:17:43,195
[The sound of PARK GUN WOOK breathing]

349
00:17:44,379 --> 00:17:46,499
It’s really hot here.

350
00:17:46,566 --> 00:17:47,767
Because it's humid here.

351
00:17:47,833 --> 00:17:51,571
[↑ PARK GUN WOOK] [HAN YU JIN →]

352
00:17:51,637 --> 00:17:52,371
[Member’s location]

353
00:17:52,438 --> 00:17:56,275
[8 remaining survivors and 4 keys left]

354
00:17:57,009 --> 00:18:00,379
[← The seeker] [The seeker →]

355
00:18:01,447 --> 00:18:04,450
[The seeker checks the Sauna]

356
00:18:04,450 --> 00:18:09,722
[SEOK MATTHEW →]

357
00:18:10,056 --> 00:18:12,325
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

358
00:18:14,394 --> 00:18:16,562
[The seeker ↓] [SEOK MATTHEW →]

359
00:18:24,570 --> 00:18:27,840
[Turns its direction and heads to the lobby outside]

360
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:32,244
I’m scared.

361
00:18:33,403 --> 00:18:35,515
[The second seeker is at the Water park]

362
00:18:45,892 --> 00:18:48,628
[2nd floor] [← PARK GUN WOOK] [HAN YU JIN →]
[1st floor] [← KIM TAE RAE]

363
00:18:55,413 --> 00:18:56,902
Please save me.

364
00:18:56,927 --> 00:18:58,738
I can’t get caught again.

365
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:00,880
Please, please.

366
00:19:09,682 --> 00:19:12,852
[The seeker heads to the 2nd floor playroom]

367
00:19:13,786 --> 00:19:15,121
Please.

368
00:19:16,389 --> 00:19:19,458
[Before the seeker arrives,
YU JIN moves inside the playroom]

369
00:19:19,559 --> 00:19:20,693
[← HAN YU JIN]

370
00:19:27,987 --> 00:19:30,002
[← The seeker]

371
00:19:33,339 --> 00:19:35,341
[The sound of the seeker’s cane]

372
00:19:36,576 --> 00:19:37,962
Please.

373
00:19:46,224 --> 00:19:49,655
[The seeker →]

374
00:19:51,224 --> 00:19:52,792
Don’t come near me. x2

375
00:19:58,164 --> 00:19:59,932
[Finds YU JIN who was hiding]

376
00:19:59,966 --> 00:20:01,500
[HAN YU JIN →]

377
00:20:01,772 --> 00:20:03,536
[Trying desperately to run away]

378
00:20:07,422 --> 00:20:08,274
I’m sorry. x2

379
00:20:08,308 --> 00:20:10,121
[HAN YU JIN, I found you!]
I’m sorry, I’m sorry!!

380
00:20:10,146 --> 00:20:10,943
I found you!

381
00:20:11,077 --> 00:20:12,045
Okay, okay.

382
00:20:14,647 --> 00:20:17,516
YU JIN was taken away right in front of me.

383
00:20:17,583 --> 00:20:20,086
Earlier, JI WOONG was taken away in front of me.

384
00:20:21,929 --> 00:20:23,642
But because I have a key,

385
00:20:24,308 --> 00:20:27,560
I’ll go rescue YU JIN.

386
00:20:29,851 --> 00:20:31,664
GUN WOOK to the rescue. x2

387
00:20:44,589 --> 00:20:46,500
[GUN WOOK waving at someone]

388
00:20:46,515 --> 00:20:50,858
[← ???]
[← PARK GUN WOOK]

389
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,473
Who is that?

390
00:20:57,213 --> 00:20:59,558
You’re alive? I saw you get caught.

391
00:20:59,646 --> 00:21:01,486
I was saved by my key.

392
00:21:01,547 --> 00:21:02,928
Oh, really?

393
00:21:03,739 --> 00:21:04,872
[YU JIN arrived in prison]
Who is that?

394
00:21:04,897 --> 00:21:06,645
I didn’t have any energy left to run away.

395
00:21:07,958 --> 00:21:09,568
I have a key.

396
00:21:13,342 --> 00:21:16,483
[Opens the lock with the key he had]

397
00:21:17,642 --> 00:21:18,842
I unlocked it.

398
00:21:21,367 --> 00:21:24,083
[YU JIN, released after 1 minute of being locked away in prison]

399
00:21:25,425 --> 00:21:27,253
I was on my way to rescue you. Who else is locked up?

400
00:21:27,711 --> 00:21:28,788
Only JI WOONG.

401
00:21:28,951 --> 00:21:30,284
Then, I guess everyone is alive.

402
00:21:30,309 --> 00:21:32,208
But, I have no clue where the rest of the people are hiding.

403
00:21:33,773 --> 00:21:36,662
[← RICKY]
[In the dark supply rental center]

404
00:21:37,306 --> 00:21:39,375
I really like this hiding spot.

405
00:21:39,479 --> 00:21:41,045
I will trust this hiding spot

406
00:21:41,152 --> 00:21:43,035
because I worked hard to make it.

407
00:21:45,145 --> 00:21:47,125
[← ZHANG HAO]
[The seeker heads to HAO’s hiding spot]

408
00:21:47,683 --> 00:21:50,792
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

409
00:21:54,375 --> 00:21:57,417
[But, just leaves]

410
00:21:58,208 --> 00:22:00,085
I really want to come out but

411
00:22:00,140 --> 00:22:02,621
the seeker keeps on coming here.

412
00:22:02,646 --> 00:22:05,891
Even though I want to move around, there are two seekers now, so I can’t.

413
00:22:06,292 --> 00:22:08,917
If one (seeker) leaves, the second one appears.

414
00:22:10,431 --> 00:22:15,367
I miss my mom. x2

415
00:22:16,064 --> 00:22:19,538
[SUNG HAN BIN, KIM GYU VIN]
[Locker Room B]

416
00:22:19,862 --> 00:22:23,750
[← SUNG HAN BIN]

417
00:22:25,167 --> 00:22:26,583
I guess they can’t see here.

418
00:22:33,259 --> 00:22:35,483
[The sound of the seeker’s footsteps]

419
00:22:35,925 --> 00:22:38,257
[← The seeker]

420
00:22:39,690 --> 00:22:41,899
[← KIM GYU VIN]

421
00:22:42,361 --> 00:22:44,430
I hear footsteps.

422
00:22:54,769 --> 00:22:57,443
[SUNG HAN BIN →]

423
00:23:04,402 --> 00:23:07,653
[Finds GYU VIN]

424
00:23:11,751 --> 00:23:12,925
What was that?

425
00:23:14,564 --> 00:23:15,808
[GYU VIN running away]

426
00:23:15,833 --> 00:23:18,764
[ and the seeker chasing after him]

427
00:23:32,516 --> 00:23:35,848
[KIM GYU VIN, I found you!]

428
00:23:40,553 --> 00:23:45,357
[The seeker looks again in Locker Room B]

429
00:24:02,007 --> 00:24:03,676
Ah, please.

430
00:24:04,733 --> 00:24:07,146
I don’t want to be caught again.

431
00:24:11,721 --> 00:24:14,253
[← SUNG HAN BIN]

432
00:24:22,711 --> 00:24:24,564
[SUNG HAN BIN, I found you!]

433
00:24:24,611 --> 00:24:26,265
How did they find me?

434
00:24:29,924 --> 00:24:32,504
[Meanwhile in the Sauna, YU JIN is figuring out the seeker’s location]

435
00:24:33,793 --> 00:24:36,709
[Rustling sound]

436
00:24:37,923 --> 00:24:39,949
What are you doing?

437
00:24:39,949 --> 00:24:40,579
MATTHEW?

438
00:24:40,579 --> 00:24:41,947
Yes.

439
00:24:41,972 --> 00:24:42,972
I was here.

440
00:24:44,916 --> 00:24:46,518
The seeker is over there.

441
00:24:50,268 --> 00:24:51,368
It’s coming, it’s coming.

442
00:24:51,390 --> 00:24:54,360
[← The seeker] [SEOK MATTHEW & HAN YU JIN ↓]
It’s over there.

443
00:25:03,883 --> 00:25:06,105
[The seeker follows them to Locker Room B]

444
00:25:06,205 --> 00:25:08,205
[The second seeker heads to Locker Room B as well]

445
00:25:10,776 --> 00:25:14,646
[← SEOK MATTHEW]

446
00:25:14,713 --> 00:25:17,549
Ah, I’m so scared.

447
00:25:36,936 --> 00:25:37,536
Ahh~

448
00:25:37,536 --> 00:25:38,037
Okay, okay

449
00:25:38,270 --> 00:25:39,538
[SEOK MATTHEW, I found you!]

450
00:25:39,538 --> 00:25:41,608
Okay,

451
00:25:41,707 --> 00:25:43,208
I’m sorry.

452
00:25:43,309 --> 00:25:44,977
Was I too obvious?

453
00:25:48,314 --> 00:25:50,782
[Phone alarm]

454
00:25:50,983 --> 00:25:55,587
The remaining time is 444 seconds.

455
00:25:55,621 --> 00:25:59,058
The seeker’s shadows, quicker than the seekers,
are on their way to find you.

456
00:25:59,158 --> 00:26:00,162
The seeker’s shadows arrive

457
00:26:00,259 --> 00:26:01,560
along with a disturbing noise.

458
00:26:01,594 --> 00:26:03,262
So, try not to get caught.

459
00:26:04,330 --> 00:26:06,765
What...

460
00:26:06,799 --> 00:26:09,067
does that mean?

461
00:26:09,334 --> 00:26:11,234
I... don’t understand.

462
00:26:11,704 --> 00:26:12,741
[(Using a translator)]

463
00:26:12,771 --> 00:26:13,605
Oh~!

464
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:15,507
'敏捷' (Quick)

465
00:26:15,941 --> 00:26:19,111
Please don’t use these kinds of words.

466
00:26:19,178 --> 00:26:22,981
They could’ve just said a ‘fast-moving’ seeker

467
00:26:23,048 --> 00:26:25,748
How was I supposed to know that hard word?

468
00:26:31,290 --> 00:26:35,661
[The ‘fast-moving’ shadows are on their way ]

469
00:26:36,195 --> 00:26:39,765
[The sound of the shadows moving]

470
00:26:45,738 --> 00:26:47,439
What is that?

471
00:26:47,506 --> 00:26:48,386
The shadows are moving in twos?

472
00:26:48,474 --> 00:26:49,976
Or is it in threes?

473
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:56,381
[The shadows are heading to the Water park
where TAE RAE and RICKY are hiding]

474
00:26:56,816 --> 00:26:59,051
[The sound of the shadows moving]

475
00:27:00,186 --> 00:27:02,788
(Lights off)

476
00:27:06,025 --> 00:27:08,660
The shadows won’t be able to find me.

477
00:27:09,261 --> 00:27:12,231
[← RICKY]
I picked a good hiding spot.

478
00:27:12,798 --> 00:27:17,136
[The shadows are heading in TAE RAE’s direction]

479
00:27:20,906 --> 00:27:21,907
[← KIM TAE RAE]

480
00:27:22,007 --> 00:27:24,376
[ The roar of the shadows]

481
00:27:24,843 --> 00:27:26,545
Wow, what is that?

482
00:27:27,012 --> 00:27:30,716
[TAE RAE, running away from the shadows]

483
00:27:40,559 --> 00:27:42,995
[KIM TAE RAE →]
[The shadows are chasing after TAE RAE]

484
00:27:42,995 --> 00:27:44,296
[The shadows are chasing after TAE RAE]

485
00:27:49,235 --> 00:27:50,802
[KIM TAE RAE ↓]

486
00:27:50,803 --> 00:27:52,604
[Successfully, ran away from the shadows]

487
00:27:53,138 --> 00:27:56,541
[Enters the cafeteria to look for places to hide]

488
00:28:00,345 --> 00:28:02,247
I almost got caught just now.

489
00:28:02,347 --> 00:28:05,183
There were even 4 shadows.

490
00:28:05,584 --> 00:28:08,253
[Remaining time]

491
00:28:08,787 --> 00:28:10,756
I...

492
00:28:10,781 --> 00:28:12,191
will save HAN BIN.

493
00:28:12,224 --> 00:28:13,392
Right now? No!

494
00:28:13,459 --> 00:28:14,860
Maybe a little later.

495
00:28:15,361 --> 00:28:17,362
No HAN BIN, you can do it.

496
00:28:19,565 --> 00:28:21,099
Okay, I’ll try to stay alive.

497
00:28:22,468 --> 00:28:24,770
[With only 200 seconds remaining, HAN BIN is rescued]

498
00:28:27,272 --> 00:28:31,710
[HAN BIN hides in the towel bin in Locker Room B]

499
00:28:39,685 --> 00:28:44,156
[The seeker appears right after HAN BIN hides]

500
00:28:50,596 --> 00:28:51,930
This doesn't look good.

501
00:28:53,866 --> 00:28:55,334
How many minutes do we have remaining?

502
00:28:55,968 --> 00:28:57,736
I want to get out.

503
00:28:58,137 --> 00:28:59,504
1 minute remaining.

504
00:28:59,504 --> 00:29:00,605
1 minute?

505
00:29:00,630 --> 00:29:02,874
Do we win if we hold out for 1 minute?

506
00:29:03,884 --> 00:29:06,478
[The seekers and the shadows hurry to find the members]

507
00:29:11,951 --> 00:29:15,587
[PARK GUN WOOK →]

508
00:29:20,393 --> 00:29:25,631
[PARK GUN WOOK]
[The seeker]
[GUN WOOK and the seeker are getting closer]

509
00:29:30,135 --> 00:29:32,604
[Passing each other by a whisker]

510
00:29:35,074 --> 00:29:36,275
[PARK GUN WOOK →]

511
00:29:36,575 --> 00:29:39,177
[The seeker chases right after it notices him]

512
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:51,323
[End of hide-and-seek]

513
00:29:52,057 --> 00:29:55,160
I can’t find you.

514
00:29:55,260 --> 00:29:57,460
Nightingale.

515
00:29:57,496 --> 00:30:03,435
I can’t find you. Nightingale.

516
00:30:07,072 --> 00:30:07,973
[After the game ended,
the members gathered near the prison]
What the?!

517
00:30:08,007 --> 00:30:08,941
You’re still alive, right?

518
00:30:09,041 --> 00:30:10,242
- Finally!
- Isn’t the survival rate more than 50%?

519
00:30:10,709 --> 00:30:11,945
